<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`PRIM_GLTF_ALPHA_MODE_MASK: number = 2`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer PRIM_GLTF_ALPHA_MODE_MASK = 2;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PRIM_GLTF_ALPHA_MODE_MASK has the value 2</p>
  <p>Alpha masked rendering mode for <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/GLTF_Overrides" target="_blank">GLTF</a> materials, used with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_GLTF_BASE_COLOR" target="_blank">PRIM_GLTF_BASE_COLOR</a>. Transparency from the texture is compared to the material's alpha cutoff, with pixels above the cutoff fully opaque and pixels below it fully transparent.</p>
</p>
    </div>

